        {
          "id": 13713,
          "hub_id": null,
          "version": "4.1.0",
          "description": "- Loot overlay has been fixed up to work again, being broke since the 3.11 -> 4.0 migration\n- Decoupled marked room loot generation from main loot generation, this will allow marked room loot to be more configurable\n- Add Ref Key Rooms by @minesettimi (Thanks!)\n- A lot of preparation to allow for presets in the future, but all of that has been disabled for now\n- Some huge code refactors to various loot generation systems\n- Added new properties `ReduceLowLooseLootRolls` and `ReduceLowLooseLootRollsAmount`  these properties allow for raising the lower end of the RNG loot rolls that takes place.\n- Fixed up marked room positions to be more accurate and include the walls (As sometimes posters can spawn on these)\n\nThere's probably another few things I forgot, but considering this has been in dev since the middle of November of last year these are the changes that I can still remember.\n\n**It is recommended to use a new config, the config layout has changed due to preparation for presets.**",
          "link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1619/lots-of-loot-redux/4.1.0",
          "content_length": 38736,
